# #71: shell scripts run on the TrueNAS box (Linux) but are often edited
# from a Windows checkout -- force LF regardless of the editing platform
# so a script committed with CRLF doesn't fail with a shebang/line-ending
# error once deployed.
*.sh text eol=lf

# #724 part b: binary test fixtures (OLE compound files), never line-ending converted.
*.doc binary
*.ppt binary
*.xls binary
